        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">For adults who'd like to begin in a group, Violin Kickstart is a four-week, live online course for new beginners and returning players, kept intentionally small. Enrollment isn't open right now, but you can <a href="/violin-kickstart#waitlist" class="text-purplePrimary underline hover:text-purple-800 transition-colors duration-150">join the Violin Kickstart waitlist</a> to hear when the next cohort is announced. If you're curious what the four weeks look like, <a href="/insights/what-to-expect-violin-kickstart" class="text-purplePrimary underline hover:text-purple-800 transition-colors duration-150">what to expect from Violin Kickstart</a> walks through it.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">If you're not sure which format suits you, you're welcome to reach out for a low-pressure conversation. We can talk through your goals and figure out a good place to start.</p>
